  "controls": "n=2 gives k_GL=1.26892 (known D=6 value ~1.27); low orders Lambda0..2 = 1,-1,2 reproduce Asnin et al. lambda=n-1+2/n; k3,k4 reproduce 1502.02820/1802.08191.",
